## Skill 0: 意图识别与编排
================================================================================

当用户输入以下关键词时，自动执行对应 Skill：

| 用户意图 | 触发关键词 | 执行 Skill |
|---------|-----------|-----------|
| 新项目 | "开始新项目" "新项目" | cost-control → socratic-inquiry → task-planner |
| 功能开发 | "开发功能" "添加功能" | cost-control → task-planner → code-review |
| Bug修复 | "修复bug" "debug" "报错" | cost-control → debug-diagnosis → code-review |
| 代码重构 | "重构" "优化代码" | cost-control → code-review → task-planner |
| 文档整理 | "整理文档" "文档太大" | cost-control → doc-processor |
| 健康检查 | "检查健康" "健康度" | cost-control → health-check |
| 深度修复 | "BugHunter" "深度修复" | cost-control → bughunter |
| 项目验收 | "验收项目" "版本验收" | cost-control → project-acceptance |
| 自动清理 | "清理项目" | cost-control → auto-cleanup |
| 多任务调度 | "subagent" "并行处理" | cost-control → multi-task-scheduler |
| **前端设计** | "设计界面" "前端开发" | design/frontend-design |
| **MCP构建** | "MCP服务器" "构建MCP" | dev/mcp-builder |
| **创建Skill** | "创建skill" "新skill" | productivity/skill-creator |
| **文档处理** | "处理Excel" "处理PDF" | productivity/{docx,pdf,pptx,xlsx} |

